{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RMSov_e4Po9hIKU-NUyDug?scene=1&click_id=4","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:36.729560+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RMSov_e4Po9hIKU-NUyDug?scene=1&click_id=4","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7TbBYgicgoQqkZBmzFzOnWTRnK8jH7CLIXz9gpPHHtoYfMkf5ibFVbT9Q/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span>dsfsdfsdf</span></p></section><p><span>东北大学计算机科学与工程学院通信-导航-探测一体化先进技术实验室2025年导师团招生现已正式启动，现面向</span><span><strong><span>2022级（目前大三）具备推免资格的优秀本科生</span></strong></span><span>开放简历投递通道。欢迎对4G、5G及B5G移动通信系统、车联网、通感一体化等前沿领域充满热情，具备扎实专业基础与学术潜力的计算机、数学、通信等相关专业同学加入我们。</span><span><span>我们期待与你携手，共同致力于通信导航与探测等前沿领域的探索与实践。</span></span></p><p><span><span>实验室网址：</span></span><span><span>http://faculty.neu.edu.cn/songxiaoshi/zh_CN/zdylm/262118/list/index.htm</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uQUHibDOicLZuISzicf7bKyvjbhyhO8bstuzibibbKHCRibvGO83tofBEx0LZDYskw4wNR0vFpYoTF9yE4wVG5QiaYsFw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>学校与学院介绍</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7bBXyvVGFfCu0CiaXF4TBaEf3urTh9HP2iaSTEpFBeRCaxk2tS4G44GEA/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>东北大学始建于1923年4月，是一所具有爱国主义光荣传统的大学。于1998年9月划转为教育部直属高校，是国家首批“211工程”、“985工程”重点建设高校，2017年入选国家首轮世界一流大学建设高校，2022年入选国家第二轮“双一流”建设高校。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7kewptm8YGr9qBAibJT9VQTHvqceWiaNVEEMZzWynkHgBVrc2Vib6neEsw/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>华天楼</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7YGWHnEnaDjGqadUNJiaXsWlplpgWKBuzHYBr3zU6hoq03ZeanFTVgAg/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>计算机科学与工程学院现设有计算机科学系、计算机工程系、通信与电子工程系、人工智能系、基础教学部5个系部， 其中计算机科学与技术专业被列入东北大学高峰学科建设计划，并在第五轮学科整体水平评估中大幅跃升。2013、2015和2018年，计算机科学与技术学科三次进入ESI排名全球前1%；2022年5月，计算机科学学科首次进入ESI全球排名前1‰。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uQUHibDOicLZuISzicf7bKyvjbhyhO8bstuzibibbKHCRibvGO83tofBEx0LZDYskw4wNR0vFpYoTF9yE4wVG5QiaYsFw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>实验室简介</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section>