VF8RZJhLFv6awrc9sicGBBbAghoUjj0w/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7qMHk7iaqKsSXYnds3KFmfSic1ks1665uGB1rmNkq7SKA5AhPswyE2hnA/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7pficHYWydib9S5F7jaoeHHWmyCplhk0h1UEibhvLylf6058gd04e2OXUw/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7H8Hp28JEBRicer4iccIodVckJnDUic0C0XZCg8jmy6s7aU5kuBUZcv1aA/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7vCBOBdfzZOw2XicrI1QwAbrajvIxWcHCQn5JdJl741nw70mzHPCopRw/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7bcicA5ezteUzIlicT7pD4nXRibsPRxtuq5ibHd1Dq0on69MbX0bdnHHAQQ/640?from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>向右滑动查看更多</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>实验室始终秉持“育人为本、全面发展”的教育理念，致力于实施全方位、多层次的人才培养战略。我们不仅关注学生在学术科研领域的卓越成长，更重视其思想道德、身心素质、审美素养与实践能力的综合提升，倡导“德智体美劳”五育并举的成长路径。在严谨的科研工作之外，实验室注重营造积极向上、充满活力的团队氛围，定期组织各类团建活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uQUHibDOicLZuISzicf7bKyvjbhyhO8bstuzibibbKHCRibvGO83tofBEx0LZDYskw4wNR0vFpYoTF9yE4wVG5QiaYsFw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>导师团选拔计划</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>导师团招生是通信-导航-探测一体化先进技术实验室选拔优秀保研生的重要方式，学生通过导师团考察后，有机会获得实验室研究生的名额。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>导师团的优势</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span><span>可自由选择感兴趣的方向，并提前获得毕设与科研指导；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>提供丰厚的奖学金和科研补助，助力学生全身心投入研究。</span></span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>导师团报名要求</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span><span>对实验室研究方向感兴趣并有较强自驱力的同学；</span></span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>预计能够获得所在学校的保研名额；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>具有较好的英语能力和数学基础的优先考虑；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>具有科技竞赛经历、实际项目研究经验的同学优先考虑。</span></span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uQUHibDOicLZuISzicf7bKyvjbhyhO8bstuzibibbKHCRibvGO83tofBEx0LZDYskw4wNR0vFpYoTF9yE4wVG5QiaYsFw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>请有意向的同学将简历和相关证明材料打包，按照“本科学校_姓名_专业_（成绩排名/专业人数）”格式命名，如“XX大学_张三_通信工程_（1_50）_导师团”，发送至songxiaoshi@cse.neu.edu.cn，注：该排名为学业成绩排名，综合排名请在简历中体现。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bMBPAWd3WiaQY1xzd1EQADY2VAZgFl1ic7Qp8Ht3Ks2ZQXeTUdm9nl7QyQ8Zo1DOnRt6x4GTayNvCxePtwOKRbXA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>-通信-导航-探测一体化先进技术实验室-</span></span></section><section><span><span><span>学院预推免QQ群：1051308142<